SY_TALK("zxTZf50NzDA",[[49,["Advice to Sahaja Yogis","on Hygiene and other Topics"]],[71,["Alpe Motta, Italy","May 4, 1986"]],[86,["These are the songs they are sung in Himalayas,","and to be sung here is something really remarkable,"]],[96,["isn’t it?"]],[97,["You brought it all the way to be sung here."]],[100,["Now, I think I have already given you a very,","very long lecture and a speech as you call"]],[109,["it, but some reactions were very good, and","some could absorb it very well."]],[120,["But some, they said, were sleeping."]],[123,["Now these things happen because of negativity."]],[127,["You have to fight your negativity, because","negativity is the thing that asks questions."]],[132,["When I am talking I am telling the truth,","absolute truth, but it asks questions and"]],[139,["it reflects."]],[141,["When it starts reflecting, nothing goes in","the head because you are left with the past"]],[146,["sentence, and the present you are not with","it."]],[149,["So the whole thing boils down to something","like an escape, and then you escape and you"]],[159,["sleep off."]],[160,["I mean, I tried My level best today to put","you onto your conscious mind."]],[163,["You have to be conscious, you have to be alert;","and that’s the point, is that unless and"]],[171,["until you are conscious you cannot ascend."]],[174,["Any abnormal person cannot ascend."]],[178,["You have to normalize yourself."]],[181,["So many of you had lots of abnormalities which","were brought out and thrown away, and many"]],[189,["have been cleansed, but now if there are some","still lingering with it, they must work it"]],[196,["out."]],[197,["They cannot just go on justifying it."]],[200,["Normally negative persons attract a negative","personality."]],[206,["So if you have such a negativity of any kind","within you, you should never sit next to a"]],[210,["negative person, never go near such a person."]],[212,["Keep away, but stick on to the positive person."]],[215,["Like I said, stick on and support your leaders","without question, without questioning."]],[225,["But this is the trouble is that you start","fighting your own leader."]],[228,["If the leader says something to you, you quarrel","with the leader and you argue with the leader,"]],[233,["so it’s finished."]],[235,["I speak through the leaders, so you don’t","question it."]],[239,["If you question it, then there will be a problem."]],[245,["You have to stick on with your leaders, who","are positive people."]],[251,["And if you start questioning them, then you","will be nowhere – no link between you and"]],[256,["Me."]],[261,["And this is everywhere: I was told in Switzerland","it is like this, in France now is better but"]],[267,["used to be like that; everywhere, except for","Italy – I think Italy has the best results."]],[273,["So don’t fight with your leaders, don’t","argue them."]],[277,["Do not reflect about Sahaja Yoga – what","can you say, what do you know, how can you"]],[282,["reflect?"]],[284,["What is your knowledge?"]],[287,["Do you question your chemistry teacher when","he says hydrogen has got two atoms or one"]],[294,["atom?"]],[295,["Do you?"]],[300,["And when you start doing this with your ego,","you are thrown out of the realm of evolution."]],[309,["So do not reflect, just listen, and try to","take it inside."]],[313,["These are all mantras; take them inside."]],[316,["Instead of that you start questioning, arguing","with your leaders, giving them advices."]],[321,["Please don’t do it – stop it now."]],[325,["This is not politics, where everybody can","advise, everybody has to say something."]],[333,["Mostly the bhoots are such; the bhootish people","go on advising and having their own say."]],[340,["And they go against the leader throughout."]],[343,["Now specially for the elderly people, I would","say, because you are more grown up sometimes"]],[347,["than the leaders are."]],[348,["Then you think you have a right to correct","your leaders – it’s not so."]],[352,["In Sahaja Yoga it is not how much you are","old, but it is how much you are evolved."]],[361,["So when you start questioning your leaders","and reflecting on their behavior or anything"]],[367,["like that, and answering them back or also","giving your ideas, you are gone."]],[375,["It’s like a link."]],[377,["Say, there’s a link between the chakras","and the cells, say it like that."]],[387,["Now if you deny the chakras, how one has to","work it out; because I am connected with them,"]],[397,["and through them you are connected."]],[402,["But when you deny them, then you fall out."]],[405,["I know what to do with the leaders, I choose","them, I arrange them, I organize them, I change"]],[411,["them; I know what to do."]],[412,["Now you people do not challenge them – is","nothing but your ego."]],[417,["In India it doesn’t happen at all, doesn’t","happen."]],[421,["Once Mother has appointed somebody it’s","accepted, because for them this is the truth"]],[425,["that they have been seeking."]],[428,["The all other is nonsense, is all complications;","and because you are so complicated, to you"]],[433,["other things look nice, you think you’re","surrendering your personalities – not at"]],[438,["all."]],[439,["Is developing, surrendering yourself to the","sap of life, to the vitality, to the vital"]],[446,["force of life."]],[447,["Surrender, accept more, accept more."]],[450,["This ego can never allow you to take inside","anything – be careful on that."]],[458,["This will never allow you to sleep, this will","never give you peace."]],[463,["It will never allow you to grow, it will never","take you to your own goal."]],[467,["So surrender that your ego of yours."]],[471,["So one thing I have to tell you: don’t fight,","don’t quarrel, don’t question, don’t"]],[476,["reflect about your leaders to begin with;","or otherwise you will be cut off."]],[486,["Keep in his good book, try to support him."]],[489,["Ask him what does he want, what help he needs."]],[492,["The more you get attached to him, the more","you get closer to him, the more you will get."]],[499,["But you see, people are very wasteful."]],[506,["They have wasted their lives in drugs, this,","that, all nonsense."]],[510,["And the women have another bad habit, is to","gossip."]],[515,["They want to gossip: gossip about this person,","criticize that person."]],[520,["It’s a very bad habit of women to gossip."]],[526,["I never pay heed to anyone who gossips, and","I don’t like a person who gossips."]],[532,["So don’t gossip about things – cheaply,","frivolously talking about others."]],[538,["It’s not necessary you should be educated,","it’s not necessary that you should come"]],[543,["from a very well-bred family, nothing is necessary;","as long as you are a Sahaja yogi, you can"]],[548,["be a diamond."]],[551,["But allow yourself to be cut into the diamond."]],[555,["Allow!"]],[558,["So the reaction of some people was very good,","they absorbed what I said, they took everything"]],[563,["inside; but some of them went off to sleep."]],[566,["Now, if those who were struggling at that","time may not have understood – it’s a"]],[571,["difficult subject, I told you, it’s a very","subtle subject, doesn’t matter."]],[575,["But those who have been like that should look","after themselves, should find out."]],[582,["I’ve found out one thing with the left-sided","people: if they can put a candle near their"]],[589,["left Swadisthana, a little far, and put one","candle before the photograph, and put left"]],[595,["hand towards the photograph and right hand","on the Mother Earth, it works."]],[601,["And the candle at the back should be kept","a little far away because it makes sounds,"]],[606,["it goes this way, that way, burns."]],[609,["Those who have been taking drugs, not LSD","but other drugs, which are drowsy people who"]],[614,["feel sleepy, whose brains are destroyed by","drug, all those people can benefit a lot by"]],[622,["this."]],[623,["Do it every day."]],[627,["Going into drug you never felt you’re surrendered","to drugs, never felt that way – which was"]],[634,["something that was going to kill you completely."]],[637,["You know how so many people are killed, so","many are dying, but you wanted to do that,"]],[641,["I don’t know, because your ego said, “All","right, go ahead, try this."]],[644,["You will be the one who nothing will happen","to you.”"]],[647,["That’s the ego suggests."]],[650,["So you did it."]],[651,["All right, doesn’t matter."]],[652,["Whatever has happened has happened, let us","clear it out, because we are seekers."]],[663,["So those who have really felt one in the lecture,","without any questioning, should know that"]],[672,["they are doing well."]],[674,["Those who were questioning, reflecting, should","know they have ego, and those who were dozing"]],[680,["out should know that they are left-sided."]],[686,["Left side is worse than the right side, because","the right side can be easily corrected: it"]],[692,["shows, it shows outside."]],[694,["People don’t like it."]],[696,["Such a person is criticized, everybody says","he’s egoistical, he’s this, that."]],[700,["Everybody knows that such a person goes out","like Hitler."]],[703,["But the left-sided person, you see, is very","pitiable and you’ll have very great pity"]],[709,["for such a person and you sympathize, and","you get lost with that person."]],[712,["They are more dangerous, and difficult to","be cured, very difficult."]],[720,["So it’s not a easy task, you have to work","it out."]],[724,["I am trying My level best."]],[725,["You should also help Me."]],[729,["I was thinking that if you can start using","a little oil for your head will be a good"]],[735,["idea, in the night."]],[736,["As Sahaja yogis you should."]],[737,["I think the hairstyle should be changed for","Sahaja yogis."]],[740,["This modern fashionable style won’t suit","us."]],[742,["Because this will, we’ll have all bald heads","one day, I can tell you, and you will see"]],[747,["the Sahasrara with a big dimple here."]],[751,["Better use some nice coconut oil, rub in your","head nicely, and in the night and in the morning"]],[758,["– after all, it doesn’t show much – and","comb your hair in a proper way."]],[763,["Because also I think, if your dresses are","like bhoots, your hair are like bhoots then"]],[768,["the bhoots will take over thinking, “Oh,","this is a bhoot sitting down here, I better"]],[771,["take hold of that bhoot.”"]],[773,["So dress up in a way – shouldn’t have","hair on your forehead at all, keep it straight,"]],[778,["make it nice, and have it absolutely clean","foreheads."]],[782,["We are Sahaja yogis: we have to change our","dresses, we have to change our styles, we"]],[786,["cannot become fashionable like these stupid","punks."]],[794,["So we are a type, by our hairstyle people","should know that these are Sahaja yogis."]],[801,["So before you start getting bald, better try","putting some oil in your head."]],[805,["That’s one very important thing the Sahaja","yogis have to do."]],[808,["They can take vibrated oil if you like and","I think olive oil is good, but better than"]],[814,["olive oil, I find, it is coconut oil is better","for the growth of the hair."]],[822,["But sometimes you can also put almond oil,","is also good, almond oil for you; because"]],[827,["if you have any problem that you feel exhausted","or your nerves need attention, you are nervous"]],[836,["type of person, then almond oil is good for","you."]],[839,["And for people who have teeth which are troubling","them, they must look after them."]],[846,["No use going to the dentist, because dentists","create problems."]],[850,["Simple thing is to use olive oil and some","salt, and rub it on your gums nicely every"]],[858,["day before sleeping."]],[860,["That will keep your teeth all right."]],[861,["You’ll be amazed, till today I have not","been to any dentist."]],[865,["Never been to a dentist, and I hope I won’t","go to a dentist."]],[874,["So, but one thing is that I have certain bad","habits, one of them is that I brush my teeth"]],[878,["quite often."]],[879,["But don’t use electrical brushes and all","that, but use brushes or use your fingers,"]],[886,["is the best way is to rub with the salt and","the oil, it’s very good for you."]],[894,["And then allow the whole thing to come out,","and then wash off."]],[897,["Then the third thing I find in Europe, that","you people do not clear your throats, and"]],[905,["your tongues, which is another thing very","much against Vishuddhi."]],[909,["And that must be one of the reasons why your","Vishuddhis are bad."]],[913,["So, though it is not in fashionable here in","the West, but very important thing is to put"]],[920,["your two fingers in the mouth and rub your","– fingers, not the thing, fingers – and"]],[926,["clean your tongue in such a way that everything","comes out in the morning."]],[931,["Is important, because that accumulates and","then it rots."]],[936,["So this has to be done."]],[937,["And may be that you might think that this","is doing, you make a noise and all that, doesn’t"]],[942,["matter."]],[943,["You have to clear out your throat; I mean,","that’s how you will keep your Vishuddhis"]],[947,["very clear."]],[948,["This is one of the things."]],[950,["And another thing is that you must always","use water as much as possible, for washing:"]],[956,["when you go for your morning ablution, water","must be used."]],[960,["The paper is a very dirty and unhygienic habit,","very dirty and unhygienic habit."]],[966,["But even if you use paper, you must use water","after that."]],[969,["It’s very important that all the time the","water should be used as much as possible;"]],[976,["for Sahaja yogis it is a very, very important","thing."]],[981,["Now for some people who will find that they","are on a subtler level quite on the verge"]],[992,["of collapse, in the way that they still have","those problems that they want to sleep with"]],[1000,["other women and they want to do all these","things: they should give up Sahaja Yoga."]],[1003,["Best is to leave us alone."]],[1005,["We can’t have such useless people with us."]],[1007,["So they should give up Sahaja Yoga and don’t","trouble us; because we can get thousands and"]],[1011,["thousands in India, we have no problem."]],[1015,["For them it is not difficult, they are already","there."]],[1019,["So those who are still like that, who are","trying to have relations with other women"]],[1024,["and having their eyes on other women, and","all the women like that, you see, all this"]],[1029,["kind of maniacs – I call them maniacs only","– should give up Sahaja Yoga and should"]],[1034,["spare us."]],[1035,["This is for definite."]],[1037,["Now, we have always been saying that those","who are very negative people will have to"]],[1041,["leave Sahaja Yoga, and the day will come."]],[1043,["So for all of you it is very necessary that","you should try to clean yourself, and never"]],[1049,["sit with a person who is negative."]],[1054,["Never make friendship with a person who is","negative."]],[1057,["Try to be more helpful to a person who is","positive."]],[1061,["Clear out yourself, clean out yourself, look","after yourself, respect yourself, love yourself."]],[1069,["Live with your dignity."]],[1071,["Cheapish thing, frivolous thing, useless thing","should not be done, and make your ego be challenged."]],[1080,["Let somebody insult you and see that, that","you do not answer back."]],[1084,["Just see it, not to get into temper."]],[1089,["Try that your ego doesn’t react."]],[1094,["That can be achieved very easily if you try","in the mirror, look at yourself and laugh"]],[1102,["at yourself, make fun of yourself."]],[1105,["What do you think of yourself?"]],[1107,["Who are you?"]],[1108,["What do you have?"]],[1110,["Nothing."]],[1112,["Now today’s lecture was really, was not","only was a great lecture, but also it was"]],[1120,["like mantras, all good for the brain."]],[1124,["And I would say that this lecture must be","listened to again and again, and to be taken"]],[1131,["in, not to be questioned."]],[1134,["Not to be questioned – to be taken in, to","be absorbed."]],[1138,["I hope that you understand this."]],[1141,["Now after this Sahasrara Puja I hope you people","try to maintain the position you have reached."]],[1149,["I would expect all of you to support, to glorify","your leaders and not in any way debase them,"]],[1162,["argue with them, give them ideas."]],[1165,["Even the wives I have said are not to argue","with the leaders."]],[1169,["It’s like pulling each other."]],[1172,["Like they said there were some scorpions sent","for investigation from different places."]],[1179,["And they saw one jar was open, and they said,","“What is this?"]],[1185,["This, from this jar all the scorpions will","jump out.”"]],[1188,["They said, “They cannot, because one comes","up, the another pulls him down.”"]],[1194,["In the same way we behave."]],[1198,["So if there’s a leader, this is ego that","makes you jealous, and this is ego that says"]],[1204,["that you know better, you better give a suggestion."]],[1209,["Not that you cannot suggest – people tell","Me also things, but if he doesn’t accept,"]],[1213,["well and good."]],[1214,["That’s a challenge to your ego."]],[1216,["It’s better that he says no to you so that","you see for yourself, “Is it my ego still"]],[1221,["insisting on that position?”"]],[1224,["Now, on the second thing that I have said,","that we should not be drawn by convention."]],[1232,["Like the convention was that, say now, this","time the English felt, the English leaders"]],[1240,["felt – which was a big mistake – that","Italians would be inconvenienced if they stay"]],[1248,["over."]],[1249,["Italians are very large-hearted people, like","Indians are, they’ll be overjoyed if they"]],[1254,["stay over."]],[1255,["But it is the English mind."]],[1256,["It’s the English who cannot tolerate one","person staying for two days."]],[1260,["They’ll ask you immediately as you go, “What","time are you leaving?”"]],[1265,["So it is their mind that worked out that way","that it will be inconvenience, because they’ll"]],[1270,["be inconvenienced."]],[1271,["Though they were told “you could stay here","till Monday, there’s no problem, you have"]],[1276,["to just pay just ten pounds”; but – “I","thought” – like that."]],[1280,["You see, it’s an English image of being","good to others; because to them anybody staying"]],[1287,["in their house, finished!"]],[1289,["They won’t even allow anybody to come inside","the house."]],[1292,["Let there be snow or anything outside, they’ll","just see and talk to you and then they’ll"]],[1296,["say."]],[1297,["I’ve seen it Myself."]],[1303,["One day we had, I had gone out; it was snowing,","and I saw a lady standing out on a doorstep"]],[1310,["with a pram, and there was a little baby."]],[1315,["And the other lady was an old lady talking","from inside, just from the chink, in a way"]],[1323,["that the door was not completely opened out."]],[1327,["And when I came back after an hour or so,","still that lady was standing outside and talking."]],[1331,["This lady didn’t have sense to say that","“you come in.”"]],[1334,["But this another lady did not mind it also,","because she must be doing the same!"]],[1348,["So the large-heartedness of anything they","cannot understand."]],[1353,["Moreover there was no problem, it was suggested","that you can stay here and you can be here."]],[1358,["Now today we had to hurry up a lot, the whole","thing was quite inconvenienced and we had"]],[1363,["to do it, because of a slight mistake that","they should have asked Me."]],[1368,["And I thought you all were staying on Monday,","because it’s logical, it’s sensible."]],[1373,["But because of the conception that “we should","not inconvenience” …."]],[1377,["It is not only with English, it is possible","with anyone of you."]],[1383,["When you start thinking “I thought,” you","are gone."]],[1388,["So these concepts that you have about things","are actually very dangerous things."]],[1394,["I’ve been having experiences of experiences","of these stupid conventions people have."]],[1402,["“I thought.”"]],[1404,["They try to be good, but ultimately try to","be nasty."]],[1410,["They are nasty."]],[1412,["So that means there’s something definitely","wrong with the convention they have about"]],[1416,["things."]],[1422,["And that’s why people, if they were right","when they were thinking, world would have"]],[1428,["been a different thing."]],[1429,["But they are thinking at a level where it’s","just everything is sloping down, and you are"]],[1436,["going downward."]],[1437,["As soon as you start thinking, you go downward."]],[1440,["Such is the defect of your thinking, because","it is bound by the tags of your conventions."]],[1448,["Wherever you think, you see, you are bound","by your conventions, and you go down."]],[1454,["I didn’t touch many points today which I","could have touched, like art, I was saying:"]],[1460,["I was amazed, an exuberance like this, a flower","like this makes Me so very happy to see a"]],[1465,["garden."]],[1466,["But to a sophisticated mind is Baroque or","something nonsensical."]],[1471,["To them one flower somewhere, because the","rest of the area should be their space for"]],[1476,["their ego."]],[1478,["So they cannot see the beauty: “it’s too","much, too much.”"]],[1490,["Even Sahaja Yoga: “there’s too much for","us.”"]],[1494,["What are you, a little baby or what?"]],[1496,["What is too much?"]],[1499,["You see, as if like a baby we give a bottle,","so much of milk, so much of milk, so “Sahaja"]],[1504,["Yoga is too much for me.”"]],[1505,["You are dwarves or what?"]],[1511,["And there’s no substance in this kind of","a nonsense."]],[1513,["That’s why “this is sophisticated,”","“this is nice,” criticize everyone."]],[1518,["People are so frightened even to decorate","their houses, because it will be criticized."]],[1524,["“Better keep it plain, white."]],[1528,["Just white.”"]],[1531,["Even the nose they don’t like, they want","to cut out the nose, eyes, everything, just"]],[1535,["have plain!"]],[1536,["And imagine, it’s the play of the ego which","wants an individuality."]],[1547,["How they are in juxtaposition with what they","want to do – see this, clearly."]],[1555,["If you go in a garden they’ll have one,","you see, tree somewhere hanging in the air."]],[1560,["This is supposed to be garden."]],[1562,["You say, “Where is the garden”?"]],[1563,["“This – garden.”"]],[1564,["Microscope: “Where is the garden?”"]],[1566,["“Oh no, we put only one thing at a point,","you see, so it becomes important.”"]],[1576,["So this is only a tree here and then you move","up, there will be another little bush, then"]],[1581,["another tree."]],[1587,["Everything is too much, why?"]],[1588,["Because the ego is too much in the head."]],[1592,["That’s why everything is too much for them."]],[1595,["This stupidity has to go now."]],[1599,["You have to take whatever is good, too much","you must take, and give up whatever is too"]],[1604,["much in you."]],[1606,["That has to be understood."]],[1608,["All these stupid ideas, all kinds of stupid","ideas – like you want to buy a house, so"]],[1616,["it’s all right, you go and buy a house."]],[1618,["I went round, and most of the houses are about","seven-and-a-half feet height, but they like"]],[1627,["it."]],[1628,["I said, “Why?”"]],[1629,["“It’s very old.”"]],[1630,["I said, “So what?”"]],[1631,["“But it’s an old house, it is this and","that, and the old houses ...”"]],[1636,["“But why do you like?”"]],[1637,["New houses are eight feet, at the most."]],[1641,["So there’s no choice."]],[1643,["But why do you want to have a house which","is old house?"]],[1647,["Victorian houses they don’t like."]],[1649,["Why?"]],[1650,["Because they are not so conventional, they","are not so fashionable."]],[1655,["You must have a house where you should break","your neck."]],[1659,["Walk into the bathroom in an awkward way,","you can’t even sit or stand; halfway you"]],[1666,["hang in the air."]],[1667,["That’s the very house of a character."]],[1671,["And a character is that which makes you awkward","and feel funny: that person “has character.”"]],[1677,["I mean, a person if he’s absurd, he’s","queer, weird, he’s strange, he’s a man"]],[1684,["of character."]],[1686,["This is the situation today."]],[1687,["He’s a man of character and he’s weird,","absolutely a strange personality."]],[1693,["How is it?"]],[1695,["“You know, he came on a bicycle with a half-pant.”"]],[1698,["I said, “Really?”"]],[1699,["“He’s a man of character.”"]],[1701,["Here he is getting arthritis with it."]],[1705,["Being queer, funny stupid things is regarded","as something of personality."]],[1711,["Now as Sahaja yogis you have to realize that","you are not that stupid."]],[1717,["You are crowned with your Self."]],[1724,["Now you are not going to behave like these","stupid people and their fashions, so give"]],[1729,["it up."]],[1730,["They laugh at you, you laugh at them!"]],[1734,["In a lunatic asylum if you go, all the lunatics","will say, “Oh, so you have also come here"]],[1743,["to join us, isn’t it?”"]],[1744,["They all think they are the wisest, and you","get lost with them."]],[1749,["You start thinking, “Am I a lunatic myself?”"]],[1753,["So you all, when you see such a person you","should just laugh at him."]],[1758,["Like a lady, you see, she thought her to be","very fashionable, she came with her dress,"]],[1766,["you see, very open, her body with all her","bones showing, and this and that."]],[1773,["And we happened to go to see that house, Myself","and My husband."]],[1777,["So as soon as he saw her, he came back and","vomited."]],[1781,["I said, “What’s the matter?’”"]],[1782,["“I saw her – I vomited.”"]],[1784,["And we got into the car, we didn’t enter","even, came away."]],[1790,["And she thought she was a very fashionable","lady, showing her bones, all her body – horrible."]],[1796,["Imagine, like a dead body standing before","you!"]],[1800,["But the dead body is regarded as fashionable,","so everybody wants to behave like a dead body."]],[1808,["Now you should see the sense in it, otherwise","you are not Sahaja yogis."]],[1817,["You must see the nonsense that is going on,","and you are not a nonsensical personality."]],[1825,["So all these things now, if you see from a","new angle – as I’ve told you now that"]],[1832,["you are higher personalities, that you have","achieved a new awareness of your chakras – you’ll"]],[1838,["be amazed, your reactions will be very, very","different."]],[1841,["If you see something like this: “Ah!”","you’ll say, “beautiful!”"]],[1846,["But till you have those horrible conventions","with you, you cannot."]],[1852,["A house which is dilapidated, absolutely going","to fall on your head, is “what a character!”"]],[1857,["The whole character will fall on your head!"]],[1862,["Absurd ideas people have."]],[1868,["And then they want something modern which","is absolutely weird and nonsensical."]],[1872,["You see, there was a lady, she built a house","– modern, and we had to climb up her steps,"]],[1880,["and every steps she has divided into smaller,","smaller pieces."]],[1883,["We were so much worried that we’ll all fall","off."]],[1886,["You see, every step was made of small, small","pieces like a step, you see, every step was"]],[1891,["made into steps."]],[1892,["So when you put your foot there you don’t","know where you are putting your foot, you"]],[1898,["see."]],[1899,["And she must have spent a lot of money making","that kind of a nonsensical thing; but to her,"]],[1903,["she would show everyone, “Now, come along,","see this.”"]],[1906,["I refused to go up."]],[1907,["I said, “I have nothing to do.”"]],[1910,["I went back."]],[1912,["Yes, yes, doesn’t matter."]],[1914,["As they show resentment, you must show resentment."]],[1915,["Stupid!"]],[1916,["It doesn’t appeal to Me, it doesn’t appeal","to Me these things."]],[1927,["I have seen and I don’t like it these things,","the way there’s one flower hanging somewhere,"]],[1932,["and anything if I see, I don’t like it."]],[1934,["I don’t enjoy it at all Myself."]],[1937,["And if I am the criteria, if I am the one","who can judge things, then I would tell you"]],[1942,["I don’t like all this nonsense."]],[1943,["The way people dress up these days they look","like clowns to Me, lunatics, like I can say"]],[1948,["brats, or you can call them – what do you","call them?"]],[1952,["– tramps."]],[1953,["You cannot make out one from the another."]],[1955,["Their lousy pants, you see, some grandfather’s","pant they are wearing, and their grandmother’s"]],[1960,["blouse on top, and the ladies walking on the","street."]],[1964,["See, is you feel there’s some funny, queer","people walking across – and they think it’s"]],[1971,["fashionable!"]],[1972,["I think from India we should get all old clothes","here and sell them off for a high price!"]],[1981,["It’s very queer."]],[1986,["You just look at it, see from this angle."]],[1990,["Standing on the hilltop you look at these","mad people, see how lunatic they are, stupid"]],[1995,["they are, how they are behaving, what is their","fashion."]],[1998,["I mean, if you see in the olden times people","used to dress up well with all kinds of frills,"]],[2008,["all kinds of things, but this is what they","don’t like."]],[2015,["Whatever is God has given us should be decorated","and respected."]],[2019,["I mean, yesterday the way you did the hall,","I mean today the way you did the whole of"]],[2026,["the hall and all that, so beautiful it looked,","so nice it looked."]],[2032,["But somebody would say, “Oh, let us have","absolutely plain thing for Mother: some dilapidated"]],[2039,["wall behind, which is about to fall down."]],[2042,["That would be real character.”"]],[2045,["How can these ideas be acceptable to Sahaja","yogis?"]],[2050,["This I just don’t understand."]],[2055,["And they pay for it."]],[2060,["They pay for these conventions and they pay","for all these kinds of odd things, they do"]],[2065,["pay for it."]],[2067,["Supposing there’s a fashion today to have","your hair cut like this on top, they’ll"]],[2071,["pay for it."]],[2073,["Then you cut them another way, they pay for","it."]],[2078,["You have to pay for all these misdoings also."]],[2081,["The fashion is: supposing somebody invites","somebody to your house, you must have a different"]],[2087,["type of a glass cup and a glass for this,","otherwise you are not all right."]],[2095,["And then what you find, there’s another","group of these hippies and all those have"]],[2098,["come, they will give you the dirtiest possible","mugs that you cannot drink anything."]],[2105,["So either you accept this nonsense or that","nonsense."]],[2111,["It’s absolutely absurd!"]],[2113,["And you know, I have seen Indians when they","are in England, they just don’t understand,"]],[2119,["they just “Cancel them, all right, cancel","them."]],[2126,["They’re mad people.”"]],[2129,["The quality of personality is very, very low,","very low, take it from Me – very low."]],[2140,["You might have ego, might exist with that","ego, but it’s very low here, accept it."]],[2151,["Innocence is missing, auspiciousness is missing,","cleanliness is missing."]],[2156,["The, the attraction of simplicity is missing","– so artificial."]],[2166,["Even the idea of simplicity is artificial."]],[2170,["With artificiality how can you have a quality","of human life?"]],[2177,["How can you?"]],[2179,["You become artificial people."]],[2183,["So give up all these conventions."]],[2188,["I am not here to propagate Indian culture","as such, but I must say if there is any culture"]],[2193,["it is in India, because this is no culture."]],[2197,["All becoming – if you walk about, I mean","you look like, when I see the people around,"]],[2204,["they look like host of mad people walking."]],[2209,["You see them on the streets, not one person","is normal."]],[2213,["America is even worse."]],[2214,["They must be doing like this, or this like","this; not one person has a proper face."]],[2222,["Is a fact, I tell you!"]],[2228,["With Sahaja Yoga your quality has come up,","it has come up."]],[2233,["You’ve become that now, so great."]],[2242,["That’s why you do not feel here there is","lakshmi."]],[2248,["You have money, but no lakshmi."]],[2252,["There’s no beauty of that."]],[2256,["It’s so desolate, like a barren land."]],[2265,["Your ego has blown off everything that was","beautiful."]],[2272,["You could not tolerate anybody’s art, so","you would not have anything artistic things"]],[2276,["in the house."]],[2277,["You need not have many things at all, so you","have plastics."]],[2287,["Beauty has run away from your lives."]],[2290,["When you talk also it’s fashionable to be","arrogant."]],[2295,["Imagine – to be arrogant, to be very dry:","there’s no beauty in it."]],[2306,["Is all put-up show; there’s no bravery in","it, nothing sublime."]],[2321,["On the subtle form you have lost it, that’s","why in the gross form you don’t see it."]],[2327,["Whatever you have lost inside is shown outside","– bankruptcy, complete bankruptcy."]],[2337,["So when you see that with others – when","I am saying “you” I am meaning the others,"]],[2342,["those who are not yet Sahaja yogis in the","West – try to understand they are at a much"]],[2347,["lower level than you are, and don’t take","to their ideas and their ways and methods."]],[2353,["Just keep yourself aloof."]],[2356,["And then you will see they’ll run after","you."]],[2358,["Ego is like a donkey: if somebody is ahead","of them, they know somebody is ahead of them,"]],[2365,["then they bend their head to that."]],[2368,["And if they see somebody is behind them, then","they kick."]],[2377,["So you have your dignity, you have your special","style, you live with a special style."]],[2381,["Don’t be one of them."]],[2383,["Dress up properly in a proper way."]],[2386,["You may have only two shirts, you may have","only three shirts, you need not have many;"]],[2394,["but have in something sensible, normal, comfortable,","and also which is not jarring to others."]],[2411,["We are the ones who are going to encourage","our art, we are the ones who are going to"]],[2416,["bring back all that is lost."]],[2419,["We can’t have Rembrandt anymore, we cannot","have Leonardo da Vinci, we cannot have Michelangelo"]],[2425,["again – finished them all completely."]],[2427,["But everybody thinks they are Michelangelo!"]],[2431,["We can’t even have, say, Gorky; we can’t","have William Blake, can we – of that courage?"]],[2451,["We cannot have Abraham Lincoln, can we have?"]],[2458,["All dwarfs, useless people."]],[2465,["You scratch them and you find they are good","for nothing, useless."]],[2467,["Out of you all these great people have to","come out now."]],[2474,["And their speciality about them, they had","their own personality, and they would not"]],[2477,["give way to any fashions or anything."]],[2480,["They wouldn’t give way to any cheap popularity."]],[2484,["Out of you people all these great personalities","are to be born."]],[2495,["So for you and for your progeny you have to","think, what are we doing in such a great work"]],[2502,["as it is."]],[2503,["It’s not only for your enjoyment that we","have a seminar, nice music, nice food, nice"]],[2506,["place, we come, we enjoy – no."]],[2511,["Enjoyment is just an advertising department."]],[2524,["You have to really work hard inside, not outside."]],[2533,["No arguments of any kind."]],[2540,["Useless!"]],[2543,["Simple thing, if I say I have to carry, say,","this box, somebody will come out and start"]],[2549,["saying, “All right, then I think we should","get a van.”"]],[2552,["“No, but a van is too much.”"]],[2553,["“Then what should we do?”"]],[2555,["They’ll go on arguing till that the box","is gone, everything is done, and I come back"]],[2559,["and say, “Now, what are you doing?”"]],[2560,["They are still discussing how to take the","box – it’s already gone!"]],[2565,["Such wasteful habits we should give up."]],[2578,["We have to have new wisdom within us."]],[2582,["All this old wisdom, you just throw it away."]],[2585,["Unless and until you do that, your ego won’t","go away."]],[2589,["It won’t leave you, unless and until you","decide to throw away all those ideas which"]],[2597,["to you appear to be the ego."]],[2602,["You have to be like children, trying to learn","something new all the time; we are to be open"]],[2610,["to learn something new all the time."]],[2612,["You have to learn – you have lost it."]],[2615,["You had something that you have lost, so many."]],[2617,["Instead of going ahead, you have lost it."]],[2621,["You were doing all right; if you had remained","on the right path you would have achieved,"]],[2628,["because after all, some countries are traditionally","very old."]],[2632,["They also got lost – like Greece, you can","say is lost."]],[2635,["Horrible Greek tragedies: I mean, you sit","down and cry for nothing at all."]],[2642,["Nothing has happened, everything is perfect;","people just go and sit down and cry."]],[2646,["It’s like you make somebody say that “This","one is dead."]],[2651,["Let us now feel that he’s dead."]],[2654,["Sit down, all of us should cry.”"]],[2658,["Stupid as that!"]],[2659,["It’s all artificially-created problems and","artificially-created gloom, because you have"]],[2664,["no real gloom, you have no real problem."]],[2666,["You have got food to eat, you’ve got everything","– that’s why you are creating problems"]],[2673,["for yourself."]],[2674,["That’s why you need psychiatrists, you need","drugs, you need this, you need that; because"]],[2679,["you have no problems, so you want to have","some problems – as simple as that."]],[2685,["Those who have problem have to fight with","it."]],[2687,["They have no time for all these nonsensical","things."]],[2692,["You have too much time."]],[2693,["All your problems are solved as far as the","material things are concerned, but still you"]],[2698,["are very much involved into it."]],[2700,["So now face it, face it clearly, that we are","not that any more."]],[2710,["We are different people."]],[2712,["We are no more worms in the mud but we are","lotuses, we have fragrance, we have powers,"]],[2720,["we are specially blessed."]],[2725,["We have a special sense of joy."]],[2728,["Let’s enjoy that and give it to others and","be glorified with it, feel the dignity of"]],[2740,["it."]],[2743,["I’m sure it is going to work out this time."]],[2747,["I have done My level best, I think, and this","lecture should really go through you all."]],[2755,["All right, any questions?"]],[2759,["(Please have some water.)"]],[2764,["Any questions you have?"]],[2768,["(Water.)"]],[2771,["They might be thinking that I’ll drink from","here!"]],[2779,["Modern idea maybe that I drink from here!"]],[2781,["So there’s no need to have glass, Mother","may like to drink from there!"]],[2790,["All right, any questions?"]],[2808,["In thoughtless awareness."]],[2822,["Now keep it up, keep it up in thoughtless","awareness – absolutely you’re blasted."]],[2828,["Keep it up."]],[2830,["Keep yourself blasted."]],[2832,["That is this ego business."]],[2833,["Little bit is still there, rudimentary: keep","it out."]],[2839,["This is meditation, where there’s no ego","any more, you are in thoughtless awareness,"]],[2850,["absolutely stunned."]],[2852,["Can’t think."]],[2854,["But that I have done, is not good – you","should do it."]],[2858,["That is the point I am commenting on."]],[2863,["Have your own personality."]],[2865,["If punks could behave like that, why can’t","you behave sensibly?"]],[2887,["And also I have to say few words about how","we behave in our day-to-day life; because"]],[2899,["a Mother has to see that they are, children","are not to be ill-bred."]],[2905,["People should not say that Sahaja yogis are","ill-bred, you see."]],[2909,["Now the first sign of an ill-bred child is","that he leaves his bed in a mess."]],[2916,["He leaves all his things in a mess."]],[2922,["While coming I saw all the beds."]],[2925,["What are we doing here?"]],[2930,["Nothing."]],[2932,["So put yourself into a discipline of leading","a neat life."]],[2938,["As a Mother I have to tell you this."]],[2942,["It takes hardly ten to fifteen minutes, but","just tell yourself this is meditation, do"]],[2948,["in meditative way."]],[2950,["We in India think that the Western people","are extremely neat and tidy."]],[2957,["Really!"]],[2960,["They can’t believe it."]],[2961,["They think you are on top of the world, you","must be the neatest people ever lived."]],[2964,["They’ll say ten times “thank you”, but","even once you will not keep your bed all right."]],[2974,["Your things should be neat."]],[2978,["You must keep yourself neat, appear neatly."]],[2986,["Then second thing I have seen, noticed this,","which is told by many people which I have"]],[2991,["also noticed, that you go to somebody’s","house."]],[2994,["Then an ill-bred person will start using the","phone without asking."]],[3000,["Certain things are important to understand,","like entering into the kitchen, eating everything."]],[3007,["It’s a very common thing people are noticing","this, that you get the food – like paupers,"]],[3018,["like beggars they come in the house."]],[3024,["I had at least twenty-one bottles of honey","which people had given Me as present, and"]],[3030,["when My son-in-law came there was not even","one bottle to give him honey."]],[3035,["So who ate?"]],[3036,["All the Sahaja yogis who came ate the honey."]],[3041,["I mean, it’s all right, but you must ask."]],[3047,["You polish off everything in the house."]],[3049,["All right, you have come, if there is a food","cooked for you, just have your food."]],[3053,["If you","go in the larder or you go anywhere, you find"]],[3063,["everything is missing."]],[3066,["You buy from the whole mart, you find everything’s","polished off."]],[3073,["So an ill-bred person can be made out like","that."]],[3078,["But you’ll be surprised, a good-breeding","person, even if this much is left of another"]],[3084,["person, that person will keep it and keep","it till it is passed over."]],[3090,["I’ll tell you about My own husband who is","– he need not worry about this thing, but"]],[3095,["if he knows we have something of another person,","he’ll put it in lock and key and see every"]],[3101,["time it is there, till he returns it to him."]],[3109,["And same I can say about My children, or anybody","I know of."]],[3117,["But this is beggarish that you take somebody’s","things, misuse it, throw away where you feel"]],[3123,["like, break everything."]],[3125,["But I have seen with My own things; so when","the leaders have been complaining to Me that"]],[3132,["“they come to our houses, they polish off","everything from our fridges” and all that,"]],[3137,["I was not surprised."]],[3141,["The Sahaja Yoga has become like a resort for","all the beggars and the paupers of the world,"]],[3148,["because it is free."]],[3149,["All the poor people come down to Sahaja Yoga,","and you have to nourish them and look after"]],[3157,["them."]],[3158,["It should not be such."]],[3160,["You may be poor, but you must have dignity."]],[3167,["Even the servants are in India better."]],[3172,["They wouldn’t touch your things without","asking."]],[3176,["They have much more breeding."]],[3182,["An ill-bred person is a person who is a rude","person, arrogant person."]],[3192,["You can say the same thing in a proper manner."]],[3196,["As a Mother, to give Me real glory is that,","that people should say that you are very well-brought-up"]],[3204,["children."]],[3207,["A kind of system must exist."]],[3223,["A spartan system."]],[3225,["It’s a spartan system."]],[3227,["It’s not all a sort of a lousy system, it’s","a spartan system."]],[3233,["You are yogis."]],[3236,["Should be neat, tidy, all the time clean,","with few things."]],[3243,["Like in India, people are quite shocked: you","carry such big, big bags, and it carries all"]],[3250,["the – for ladies specially – all the paints","and this and that."]],[3253,["Where are you going to use before the villagers","there, these paints?"]],[3260,["They don’t understand."]],[3263,["All these things we have to see for ourselves."]],[3266,["We have to be dignified, we have to be people","with a kind of a personality."]],[3279,["Supposing somebody is a saint."]],[3280,["He might be a poor man, but you can make him","out by his dignity."]],[3288,["There was a saint called Tukarama whom, which","you have heard about him – this all may"]],[3293,["be, I don’t know, was coming from his music."]],[3299,["He was poor and very generous also."]],[3302,["He used to give away everything, and always","left with very little."]],[3308,["So Shivaji Maharaj, the great Shivaji came","down to his place, brought lots of ornaments"]],[3317,["and things and presentations, and gave it","to his wife and children."]],[3322,["He was out."]],[3323,["She was very happy to wear all these things","because he gave."]],[3326,["He said, “This is ...” Of course, in the","beginning she also said that it’s not all"]],[3330,["right."]],[3331,["But he said, “No, I am just trying to sort","of pay my respects to you, this, that, and"]],[3336,["give.”"]],[3337,["And she wore it."]],[3338,["He came."]],[3339,["He said, “No, I am a saint."]],[3345,["You take this."]],[3346,["You are a king, and you have to live like","a king."]],[3349,["All right, as a king you can have it."]],[3356,["But not – as a saint I don’t need all","these things, my wife doesn’t need all these"]],[3361,["things."]],[3362,["Because you are living like a king, you – maybe","you are a realized soul also, but you are"]],[3367,["a king, so live like a king.”"]],[3374,["But one has to realize that in Sahaja Yoga","you are not to move like a barren personality"]],[3381,["also."]],[3382,["You have to be properly dressed, properly","appearing."]],[3387,["You should not look like beggars, but you","should look like dignified people of the society."]],[3396,["Now for example, as you know I am the Goddess,","and the Goddess has to wear I don’t know"]],[3402,["how many ornaments just to adorn Her chakras."]],[3406,["I mean, I have lots of ornaments Myself of","My own."]],[3411,["But only for puja I wear, otherwise I don’t","wear: I am supposed to wear lots of things."]],[3419,["Why?"]],[3420,["Because it may not be that – all right,","may be dignified, but may not be that all"]],[3427,["right to wear all those things all the time."]],[3432,["But I am supposed to wear."]],[3433,["Like You are supposed to wear many more things","in the hand here, rings on the feet, everything."]],[3440,["All the time You have wear gold in the – what","do you call the – you don’t have that"]],[3448,["ornament here which we tie up like a belt."]],[3453,["But I don’t do it."]],[3458,["I keep it to a marginal point; only in puja","I wear some things out of it."]],[3466,["So you must have that discretion: what to","wear, how to wear, how far to go, how to look"]],[3475,["dignified, how to be well-bred, so that you","glorify the breeding of your Mother."]],[3486,["This time I hope when you all come to India,","you will notice all these things among Indians."]],[3496,["You will never see them eating, you’ll never","see them having their baths, you will never"]],[3502,["see them sleeping."]],[3506,["You don’t know how they live, where they","live, how they work out, everything."]],[3510,["They are just there on the spot whenever you","are there."]],[3515,["Isn’t it true?"]],[3516,["They take their baths, they finish everything,","early in the morning, about four o’clock"]],[3521,["or five o’clock they are out – spartan."]],[3527,["And always clean: whether he’s a villager,","whether he is a scheduled caste or a brahmin"]],[3534,["or anything, they’re all neatly dressed,","you cannot make them out."]],[3539,["Clean white clothes they’ll wear, clean","white cap they will have."]],[3548,["They’ll never have dirty clothes."]],[3558,["So this is another side, which is not so sublime","on your side and not so subtle and, but it’s"]],[3567,["very important; because whatever is in the","subtle expresses outside."]],[3580,["In all your behavior this would shine, like","thousand facets of a diamond, because you"]],[3591,["have attended now the Sahasrara Day – let’s","see; what are the thousand facets will show."]],[3600,["Love each other, respect each other, respect","yourself, and all the time say one mantra"]],[3613,["within yourself, “I am a Sahaja yogi.”"]],[3617,["It says everything about your responsibilities,","what are your aspirations, what you are."]],[3621,["You","are a Sahaja yogi, being reborn by Adi Shakti"]],[3634,["Herself."]],[3646,["Any personal problems you have you should","write to Me, and I’ll try to answer."]],[3650,["If I do not answer, then think that answer","I have managed."]],[3655,["If I do not answer, then think that I have","managed the answer; but if there’s anything"]],[3659,["to be suggested I will definitely inform you."]],[3662,["Any other problem."]],[3665,["But like a lady today came, she was crying","about her husband."]],[3670,["This she did before also, again today she","is crying – she’ll go mad."]],[3674,["A Sahaja yogi should not cry."]],[3678,["Overcome your problem, try to handle your","husband, try to handle everything."]],[3683,["I do not very much like the divorce part of","it, but if somebody’s a gone case is all"]],[3688,["right."]],[3689,["If I say it’s a gone case, you divorce."]],[3692,["But unnecessarily, just because there’s","not yet proper understanding, one should not"]],[3699,["cry, weep and do all these things."]],[3701,["On the contrary, one should try to overcome","your own personal problems, because you have"]],[3712,["powers."]],[3718,["And You can write to Me."]],[3719,["Not very long letters, but I get lost!"]],[3723,["Ha, really, I get lost!"]],[3736,["In the morning there are so many letters for","Me to read, one better than the other, and"]],[3743,["My husband also get a big post."]],[3749,["But he says, “Nobody writes me love letters,","they all write about their bills to be paid.”"]],[3756,["I said, “It’s just the same!”"]],[3773,["(You may translate this, Gregoire, if they","want.)"]],[3784,["Letters … full of","problems …"]],[3819,["I said, “I have to pay for their love.”"]],[3824,["That’s what it is."]],[3828,["But children write very sweet letters."]],[3835,["They just make some painting or something,","or some flowers and few things there, that’s"]],[3841,["all."]],[3842,["They’ll make the heart and put Me there,","or something like that; very sweet, sweet"]],[3848,["things they do."]],[3849,["And just the joy and happiness, you see, they","express it."]],[3856,["Never their problems – they have no problems,","children don’t have, they are not complicated."]],[3860,["We catch hold of the problems, that’s the","trouble is."]],[3863,["They have no problems of any kind."]],[3870,["So you have not told Me, any one of you, anything","that you want Me to be done."]],[3875,["Now only thing, at the last I would like you","to listen to Warren who will read it out to"]],[3880,["you, the programs we are going to have in","this summer-time."]],[3905,["Come forward."]],[3906,["…. Yes, now."]],[3909,["…. No, no, no, then I go to Houston."]],[3920,["…. Yes."]],[3921,["And then visiting London, that’s all."]],[3924,["…. Yes."]],[3925,["…. Twenty-seventh I think, I go."]],[3927,["Yes, twenty-seventh."]],[3928,["…."]],[3929,["That’s not definite, but we’ll see."]],[3931,["In the evening."]],[3932,["…. Puja."]],[3933,["That’s the puja for Belgium and Holland."]],[3936,["…. No, better to have puja at a place where","we have the Monday program."]],[3942,["In Belgium."]],[3943,["No, just after that."]],[3945,["About fourteenth I come back?"]],[3948,["So that is what, a Saturday or a Sunday?"]],[3951,["…. Spanish people are here still?"]],[3952,["Or they are gone?"]],[3953,["…. So, they would like Me to be there for","a weekend, or for the weekdays?"]],[3955,["That’s the point to be decided."]],[3957,["…. One day …. So, what is – Spanish","people, are they more available on weekends"]],[3963,["or weekdays?"]],[3964,["Weekdays, weekdays."]],[3965,["So I can fly on, say, Tuesday."]],[3968,["On Monday I can fly, and Tuesday we can have","a program: Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday – three"]],[3980,["days, all right?"]],[3983,["Yes."]],[3984,["And then I can – we have to have a puja,","so on Friday."]],[3997,["Or I go on Monday would be better: Monday,","Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday."]],[4007,["And Friday I can go to …."]],[4008,["I can come Sunday evening, and Monday morning","you’ll have the puja, it’s better."]],[4018,["And we have programs after the puja; it’s","much better to have programs afterwards."]],[4026,["Then My vibrations are also released."]],[4030,["So Monday morning we’ll have puja."]],[4034,["…. Have you given them the saris and things","like that?"]],[4046,["No, no."]],[4047,["No, no, no."]],[4049,["Sunday I’m coming back."]],[4051,["No."]],[4052,["Then next Sunday is what?"]],[4055,["What is the following Sunday?"]],[4059,["Ah, twenty-first."]],[4061,["Monday."]],[4062,["Puja, morning Monday."]],[4064,["Or you can have it Sunday night if you like,","puja, which will suit better – Sunday night."]],[4071,["For puja, Sunday night would be better."]],[4080,["So Sunday morning I’ll go."]],[4081,["Twenty-first Sunday morning I come, all right?"]],[4084,["All right."]],[4085,["Then Sunday we have puja, Monday, Tuesday,","Wednesday I could be there."]],[4088,["Thursday I’ll go to Montpellier, and I can","return from there to London."]],[4097,["How many days?"]],[4098,["Three days are sufficient?"]],[4100,["Three."]],[4101,["…. Keep it four now."]],[4102,["So I’ll reach there on Sunday; Monday, Tuesday,","Wednesday – it’s all right, four days."]],[4107,["Thursday morning I’ll go to Montpellier."]],[4110,["Thursday evening we’ll have program there,","and then … Is there a direct flight?"]],[4124,["…. But is there a flight from there to London?"]],[4132,["It’s a rather out-of-the-way thing."]],[4135,["Is there?"]],[4136,["So why not do Montpellier first, and then","go to Spain?"]],[4140,["But from Montpellier to Spain, is there a","flight or not?"]],[4147,["That you find out first of all."]],[4151,["But you keep it that time, about that time;","definite we’ll let you know, once we have"]],[4162,["done with the Montpellier."]],[4174,["…. No flight?"]],[4176,["…. But in any case you keep this program","with them."]],[4183,["Otherwise I’ll do it earlier or later, whatever","it is."]],[4188,["First of all keep this program, definite."]],[4191,["See, Montpellier even if I don’t do, France","is there, it’s all right."]],[4215,["I can do it later on, doesn’t matter."]],[4220,["But this I have to do, Spain, properly."]],[4227,["All right?"]],[4228,["Rather awkward, I think, to go from there,","isn’t it?"]],[4235,["There’s no flight."]],[4237,["It’s too much for Me."]],[4240,["Then I have to travel back, you know; I’m","coming from America all the way."]],[4251,["So forget about Montpellier."]],[4257,["Somehow or other try to tell them that let’s","forget about it."]],[4278,["See, I must also think how far I can go."]],[4295,["Then"]],[4317,["I have to","go"]],[4385,["back"]],[4446,["to"]],[4553,["India – sixth or so, fifth or sixth, so","hardly any time for Me to prepare to go."]],[4561,["Also better keep it like that."]],[4563,["Just tell them that it may not be possible;","so I come back on Friday, it would be better."]],[4581,["I can come Saturday night, and Sunday morning","we can have the puja, if you like."]],[4588,["And Saturday arrive, Sunday puja, Monday,","Tuesday, Wednesday."]],[4596,["And Thursday morning I go back to London."]],[4599,["Because, you see, I’ll have hardly two weeks","left for Me to go to India."]],[4604,["It’s too much strain."]],[4607,["So I won’t be able to do this time."]],[4620,["They can all come to France."]],[4623,["They can come to Paris."]],[4631,["Yes."]],[4636,["They should bring all the people."]],[4637,["And we have place there for people to live."]],[4640,["During that time there’s no problem."]],[4645,["France, when am I going?"]],[4649,["Seventeenth?"]],[4650,["Will it be cold now?"]],[4655,["No."]],[4656,["After some time it will happen that I’ll","settle down in one place, and you’ll all"]],[4660,["have to come there; because I won’t be able","to travel so much, I can tell you this much"]],[4663,["– it’s all right for the time being."]],[4667,["You must also understand that now, the Mohammed","has gone to the mountains; now the mountains"]],[4673,["have to come to the, to Mohammed."]],[4677,["All right."]],[4679,["So thank you very much."]],[4680,["You haven’t told Me any one of your problems,","so I think there are no problems!"]],[4709,["Tomorrow morning I may not be able to meet","you, so may God bless you all."]],[4719,["Give yourself a bandhan now, all of you, properly,","with full attention, with full dignity, with"]],[4732,["full movement."]],[4734,["See, full."]],[4736,["Nothing should be done cheaply."]],[4746,["I don’t need anything, but just doing it","to please you all."]],[4788,["In India they asked a question that if She’s","the Goddess, why does She say namaskar to"]],[4798,["everyone?"]],[4799,["They can’t understand that God is saying","namaskar!"]]]);
